icated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.5522) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1165G7 @ 2.80GHz (8 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"1916\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/367ce0f9-28bf-4044-a9c6-cd9109569621\" />\n<img width=\"1909\" height=\"1023\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df5cd093-a95c-4612-a0de-772eec1295f3\" />\n<img width=\"556\" height=\"793\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb605ac7-119a-48be-9568-54a429ab2075\" />\n<img width=\"404\" height=\"215\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/281b25c6-54dd-4b5b-9b0a-627991d7c552\" />\n<img width=\"189\" height=\"194\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32ec8049-c742-4600-ad4e-23134b412ae6\" />\n<img width=\"167\" height=\"149\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1eb3f18-7a7a-4a2c-8165-7af0911664f3\" />\n<img width=\"270\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03b223d6-256c-4a31-b819-fbf6ff75be90\" />\n<img width=\"138\" height=\"129\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb67d6a5-a6f2-428f-8e41-187b47390a57\" />\n<img width=\"1911\" height=\"1025\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f567df65-b2b5-4705-b1f6-d892a35b7e0f\" />\n\nAny image I import that is completely white ends up with transparent/colored \"holes\" in blue, green, or red. These are simple images exported from Figma.\n\nIn the game, they have these \"holes,\" but sometimes they don't! I can't say exactly when they happen, but I've noticed it when switching scenes, although this problem doesn't always occur.\n\nIn the editor, it happens in almost 90% of attempts, as shown in the screenshots.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSimply import an image with some or all white elements using the default settings #FFFFFF.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25815592/test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117181/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}